      "refersTo": "story-choice",
      "description": "陪画的已选配色示例；题材以三张实际草图呈现，配色有真实数据色签，所有陪画选项以 aria-pressed、边线和已选文字共同标记。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-story-choice\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-swatch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i style=\"background-color:#acd9ca\"></i><i style=\"background-color:#d8e8f0\"></i><i style=\"background-color:#62988b\"></i></span><small class=\"ds-choice-mark\">已选</small><span>薄荷雨夜</span><small>安静的薄荷青压住窗外雨声</small></button>",
      "css": "@font-face{font-family:RoomBody;src:url(\"assets/fonts/v20/RoomBody.woff2\") format(\"woff2\");font-weight:400;font-display:swap}.ds-story-choice{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;text-align:left;width:100%;border:1px solid #e8ccd7;border-radius:13px;background:#fffdfd;color:var(--ink,#323142);padding:.65rem .85rem;min-height:48px;cursor:pointer;font-family:RoomBody,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;transition:border-color .2s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)),background .2s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1))}.ds-story-choice span{font-size:.89rem}.ds-story-choice small{font-size:.74rem;color:#785969;margin-top:.2rem}.ds-story-choice:hover{border-color:#b54a70;color:#8f3456;background:#fff0f6}.ds-story-choice:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-story-choice:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#215c89);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-story-choice{min-height:52px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-story-choice{transition:none;animation:none}}.ds-story-choice{position:relative}.ds-story-choice[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--rose,#b74063);background:#fceaf1}.ds-choice-mark{align-self:flex-end;color:#8f3456!important;font-size:.65rem!important;margin:0!important}.ds-swatch{display:flex;width:100%;gap:3px;margin:0 0 .3rem}.ds-swatch i{display:block;flex:1;height:14px;border:1px solid #96717f;border-radius:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "局部阅读面板",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "room-panel",
      "description": "房间中的轻量阅读层；示例仅呈现现役标题、内容和关闭结构，不合成新插画。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-room-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"ds-panel-title\"><header class=\"ds-panel-header\"><h2 id=\"ds-panel-title\">刚才说过的话</h2><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"收起当前内容，回到房间\">回到房间</button></header><div class=\"ds-panel-body\"><p>欢迎回来。今天……想先看看哪里？</p></div></section>",
      "css": "@font-face{font-family:RoomBody;src:url(\"assets/fonts/v20/RoomBody.woff2\") format(\"woff2\");font-weight:400;font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:RoomTitle;src:url(\"assets/fonts/v20/RoomTitle.woff2\") format(\"woff2\");font-weight:400;font-display:swap}.ds-room-panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;background:#fff9fb;color:var(--ink,#323142);border:1px solid #ecd1dc;border-radius:22px;box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(102,64,80,.13);overflow:hidden;font-family:RoomBody,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-weight:400;}.ds-panel-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem .65rem;border-bottom:1px solid #efdfe6}.ds-panel-header h2{margin:0;font-family:RoomTitle,serif;font-size:clamp(19px,1.65vw,28px);font-weight:400;line-height:1.3}.ds-panel-header button{flex:none;background:none;border:0;color:#765666;font-size:.75rem;padding:.5rem;min-height:44px;max-width:5.5rem;cursor:pointer;font-family:RoomBody,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-weight:400;}.ds-panel-header button:hover{cursor:pointer}.ds-panel-body{min-height:0;overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;padding:1rem 1.25rem}.ds-panel-body p{margin:.35rem 0 1rem;font-size:.91rem;line-height:1.75}.ds-panel-header button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#215c89);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-room-panel{border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(112,69,90,.07)}.ds-panel-header{padding:.65rem .85rem}.ds-panel-header h2{font-size:21px}.ds-panel-body{overflow:visible;padding:.85rem}.ds-panel-body p{font-size:.88rem}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "观察器关闭按钮",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "inspector-button",
      "description": "观察器中的关闭操作，保持原生按钮、44px 命中区与可见焦点。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-inspector-button\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭观察，回到房间\"><svg class=\"ds-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></svg><span>关闭</span></button>",
      "css": "@font-face{font-family:RoomBody;src:url(\"assets/fonts/v20/RoomBody.woff2\") format(\"woff2\");font-weight:400;font-display:swap}.ds-inspector-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;flex-shrink:0;min-width:44px;min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #cdb2bf;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink,#323142);font:400 15px/1.25 RoomBody,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)),border-color .15s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1))}.ds-inspector-button:hover{background:#f8e9ef;border-color:#b77c94}.ds-inspector-button:active{background:#efd4df}.ds-inspector-button:disabled{opacity:.58;cursor:default}.ds-inspector-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#215c89);outline-offset:3px}.ds-icon{width:24px;height:24px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex:none}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-inspector-button{transition:none;animation:none}}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-inspector-button span{display:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "观察器缩放输入",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "inspector-zoom",
      "description": "原生范围输入用于 100%–200% 缩放；组件预览展示初始值，运行时由观察器同步百分比。",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-zoom-control\" for=\"ds-inspect-zoom\"><span>放大</span><input id=\"ds-inspect-zoom\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"1\" aria-label=\"画面缩放比例\" aria-valuetext=\"100%\"><output for=\"ds-inspect-zoom\">100%</output></label>",
      "css": "@font-face{font-family:RoomBody;src:url(\"assets/fonts/v20/RoomBody.woff2\") format(\"woff2\");font-weight:400;font-display:swap}.ds-zoom-control{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-width:0;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--ink,#323142);font-family:RoomBody,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5}.ds-zoom-control input{min-width:65px;width:clamp(80px,14vw,190px);height:44px;margin:0;accent-color:var(--rose,#b74063);cursor:pointer}.ds-zoom-control input:hover,.ds-zoom-control input:active{cursor:pointer}.ds-zoom-control input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#215c89);outline-offset:3px}.ds-zoom-control output{min-width:4ch;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-zoom-control{flex:1;gap:8px}.ds-zoom-control input{width:100%;flex:1}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "共享字幕页脚",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "dialogue-panel",
      "description": "字幕跟随当前面板；中文为主，日文和准备状态附在同一处，示例展示声音失败的重试入口。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-dialogue-footer\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"><p class=\"ds-dialogue-zh\">欢迎回来。今天……想先看看哪里？</p><p class=\"ds-dialogue-ja\" lang=\"ja\">おかえり。今日は……どこから見たい？</p><span class=\"ds-voice-status\">声音暂时没有播放，台词已经留下。可以再听一次。</span><div class=\"ds-voice-tools\"><button type=\"button\">再听一次</button><button type=\"button\">停止</button><button type=\"button\">回看对话</button></div></div>",
      "css": "@font-face{font-family:RoomBody;src:url(\"assets/fonts/v20/RoomBody.woff2\") format(\"woff2\");font-weight:400;font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:RoomJapanese;src:url(\"assets/fonts/v20/RoomJapanese.woff2\") format(\"woff2\");font-weight:400;font-display:swap}.ds-dialogue-footer{padding:.65rem 1.1rem .9rem;border-top:1px solid #ecdde4;background:#fff4f8;color:var(--ink,#323142);font-family:RoomBody,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-weight:400;}.ds-dialogue-zh{margin:0;font-size:.94rem;line-height:1.7}.ds-dialogue-ja{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-family:RoomJapanese,RoomBody,sans-serif;font-size:.76rem;line-height:1.6;color:#775565}.ds-voice-status{display:block;margin-top:.3rem;font-size:.68rem;color:#705367}.ds-voice-tools{display:flex;gap:.7rem;align-items:center;margin-top:.3rem}.ds-voice-tools button{border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #c88aa0;background:none;font-size:.75rem;padding:.15rem .05rem;color:#744357;min-height:44px;min-width:44px;cursor:pointer;font-family:RoomBody,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6}.ds-voice-tools button:hover{cursor:pointer}.ds-voice-tools button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#215c89);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-dialogue-footer{padding:.65rem .85rem}.ds-dialogue-zh{font-size:.91rem}.ds-dialogue-ja{font-size:.75rem}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "陪画工具与文字回应",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "drawing-footer",
      "description": "陪画工具置于字幕页脚，正文滚动时仍可见，离开该面板即移除；默认保留十二条分支文字，配音须主动点击并使用对应音频的准确字幕。选择日志用正文中的原生 details 折叠；安静阶段按保存的 20/45/75 秒恢复，不设完成门槛。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-drawing-footer\"><div class=\"ds-drawing-tools\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">偷看画到哪里了</button><button type=\"button\">听她说说画稿</button><button type=\"button\">先把画稿留在这里</button></div><div class=\"ds-drawing-caption\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"><p>门只开这么大……但月亮还是看得见。</p><span>文字回应</span></div></div>",
      "css": "@font-face{font-family:RoomBody;src:url(\"assets/fonts/v20/RoomBody.woff2\") format(\"woff2\");font-weight:400;font-display:swap}.ds-drawing-footer{padding:.65rem 1.1rem .9rem;border-top:1px solid #ecdde4;background:#fff4f8;color:var(--ink,#323142);font-family:RoomBody,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;max-height:38%;overflow:auto}.ds-drawing-tools{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;border:0;padding:0;margin:0 0 .4rem;gap:.25rem}.ds-drawing-tools button{border:1px solid #deb9c9;background:#fffdfd;color:var(--ink,#323142);border-radius:18px;min-height:44px;margin:.1rem 0;padding:.35rem .5rem;font-family:RoomBody,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.6;cursor:pointer}.ds-drawing-tools button:hover{border-color:#b54a70;color:#8f3456;background:#fff0f6}.ds-drawing-tools button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#215c89);outline-offset:4px}.ds-drawing-caption p{margin:0;font-size:.94rem;line-height:1.7}.ds-drawing-caption>span{display:block;margin-top:.3rem;font-size:.68rem;color:#705367}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-drawing-footer{padding:.65rem .85rem;max-height:none}.ds-drawing-caption p{font-size:.91rem}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "清爽日光里的小小做客",
    "overview": "角色和房间先于界面出现：樱粉墙面、浅木家具、银蓝头发与窗外日光构成主体，按钮和文字以少量浅色载体靠近可操作的物件。可爱来自她伸出的手、认真落笔的姿态、软软的袖口和眼神，不依靠额外爱心、脏纹理或厚重框架。\n\n这是一个低密度、物件在场的视觉系统。背景、人物和画板以本地栅格分层呈现；短手写门签保留随手写下的亲近感，细线图标与清楚的中日文负责操作。需要阅读或选择时才展开轻量面板，完成后让视线回到角色；纸面只承载真实的作品、留言和少量引用，不覆盖整个房间。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "清爽赛璐璐房间与银发蓝眼角色占据视觉中心。",
      "玫红行动、近白控件和细线图标保持轻巧而可辨认。",
      "龙藏体只写房间门签，文楷写短标题与纸条，Noto 负责中日文阅读。",
      "字幕只有一份，随当前操作上下文移动，不叠加多套反应浮层。",
      "桌面保留空间关系，手机将阅读和操作接到画面下方。",
      "作品本身、手与画板的关系承担共同创作的视觉证据。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Clear Surface Rule",
        "body": "文字所处背景会随场景改变时，使用紧凑的稳定浅底保证阅读；不把大面积半透明罩层铺到人物和房间上。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Four Font Jobs Rule",
        "body": "RoomSign 只负责固定 h1，RoomTitle 负责短标题与纸条，RoomBody 负责中文，RoomJapanese 负责日文；新增内容先选职责，再选字号。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Caption Rule",
        "body": "同一个字幕节点在房间、任务面板和观察器之间移动；新回应替换旧回应，中文为主、日文为辅，声音状态与重试留在相同上下文。",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Image Owns Depth Rule",
        "body": "房间的透视和遮挡由图像承担，界面阴影只解释可操作层；不要用厚木框、硬偏移投影或额外暗罩重画房间边界。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** 让角色、房间和真实物件承担视觉焦点，控件靠近它所操作的内容。",
      "**Do** 用清爽赛璐璐、冷白银发、清透肤色与浅木家具保持人物和环境连续。",
      "**Do** 保留五套服装在实时人物姿态间的连续性，同时明确区分收藏画作与当前人物。",
      "**Do** 保持 RoomSign、RoomTitle、RoomBody 与 RoomJapanese 的字体职责和本地资源来源。",
      "**Do** 用稳定浅底、中文标签、可见焦点和至少 44×44px 命中区实现可读可操作的轻量界面。",
      "**Do** 让手机阅读回到文档流，并保留可见地点栏与物件入口。",
      "**Do** 保持单一字幕节点，让音频失败、准备状态和重试留在当前上下文。",
      "**Do** 让九张新作品以真实配色素材呈现，并让手、笔、画板与作品共用正确的坐标关系。",
      "**Do** 用实际保存的画作和纸条表达回访，把未完成稿与共同成稿区分清楚。",
      "**Do** 尊重原生滚动、原生输入和减少动态偏好，保持图像比例与退出路径。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** 用深棕粗框、大片重复稿纸、油画脏纹理、颗粒、灰棕罩层或通用爱心替代角色气质。",
      "**Don't** 把房间重新拆成七幕长页面、功能卡目录或强制按顺序解锁的地点。",
      "**Don't** 让面板和装饰遮住脸、手、笔尖，或用拉伸图像修补构图问题。",
      "**Don't** 把旧作品的滤镜兼容表现推广为新作品的配色机制。",
      "**Don't** 为贴近参考图牺牲文字对比度、中文语义或触控命中区。",
      "**Don't** 叠加多套 toast、表情角标和字幕条，或让自动动作伪造一段共同经历。",
      "**Don't** 把长段正文改成手写字，也不要让五字门签字体承担未包含的字符。",
      "**Don't** 把观察器资源的等比导出标成原生分辨率。",
      "**Don't** 添加官方截图、动画音轨、声优声纹克隆、运行时外链字体或未记录来源的素材。"
    ]
  }
}
